{"unit_id":"stars2022__dsh-ui-concise#feature-1","repo":"stars2022/dsh-ui-concise","commit":"e2b3750d43b3b2b3ee2dd638c9281795cf3cb1bc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-concise 的功能「逐轮折叠」：将一轮中的处理步骤放在计时折叠区内，完成时默认收起，最终助手回答保留在折叠区外。点击计时栏可查看处理过程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:5745-5774","lib/client.js:5915-5992"]}
